name 'iterating-with-ai-postassessment-q5_2025'

question 'In a "Read → Transform → Render" pipeline, what happens during the "Transform" step?'

wrong 'The raw data is displayed directly onto the screen.'
wrong 'The developer manually types in new values for every item.'
right 'The data is modified or filtered (e.g., converted to uppercase or narrowed down) before it is turned into UI elements.'
wrong 'The array is deleted to save memory.'

allow_multiple_attempts false

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 4

The transform step is where logic is applied to the data to prepare it for the user's view, such as filtering, sorting, or formatting.
MARKDOWN
